          <a href="https://upstage.ai/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors">打开 Upstage 定价页 →</a>
